; One variable: the orange box is a Node3D under a plain Node under a hidden Node3D. Godot climbs
; visibility only through Node3D parents (node_3d.cpp:1132-1143), so the orange box draws beside
; the grey reference. No other golden hides a Node3D above a plain Node, so a hide that reaches
; across one shows only here.

